<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd">
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
<meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8" />
<title>无标题文档</title>
<style type="text/css">
	body{
		font-size:80%;
	}
	.title{
		font-size:18pt;
		font-family:"微软雅黑";
		padding-bottom:30px;
		padding-left:20px;
	}
	
	.inline_title{
		font-size:18pt;
		font-family:"微软雅黑";
		color:#FFCC00;
	}
	.link{
		font-size:8pt;
		text-decoration:underline;
	}
	
	#content{
		width:500px;
		border-width:1px;
		border-style:dashed;
		border-color:#000099;
		padding:10px;
		margin:10px;
	}
	
	#next{
		width:500px;
		text-align:center;
		padding:20px;
		margin:20px;
	}
</style>
</head>

<body>
<div id="container">

<div class="title">购买冰果产品</div> 

<div id="content">
您选择的是 <span class="inline_title">大学生英语四级考试</span> <span class="link">重新选择</span><br />

请输入您的活动代码 <input type="text" /> （没有请留空白）<br />
</div>

<div id="next">
<a href="next.html">下一步(选择支付方式)</a>
</div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
